{"overview":"یک بیگانه خوشحال، تاکوپی، با یک مأموریت به زمین می‌رسد: گسترش شادی! وقتی با شیزوکا، یک دانش‌آموز چهارم تنها، ملاقات می‌کند، عهده می‌گیرد که با وسایل جادویی خوشحالی‌اش، لبخند او را بازگرداند. اما وقتی دردهای او را کشف می‌کند، تاکوپی می‌آموزد که شادی واقعی ممکن است فراتر از وسایل باشد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A Happy alien, Takopi, lands on Earth with one mission: to spread happiness! When he meets Shizuka, a lonely fourth grader, he vows to bring back her smile using his magical Happy Gadgets. But as he uncovers the pain in her life, Takopi learns that true happiness may require more than gadgets.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":6,"y":2025,"poster":"/xINTurnhTo8ojWJSmtw3yWEBAPs.jpg"}],"episodes":6,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"間宮くるみ","role":"Takopi (voice)","photo":"/69HpNCiAU2AXwNhltWgFrDnM7a9.jpg","en":"Kurumi Mamiya"},{"name":"上田麗奈","role":"Shizuka Kuze (voice)","photo":"/2WV61uVU7y6XGYqNHLMpP0sApdu.jpg","en":"Reina Ueda"},{"name":"小原好美","role":"Marina Kirarazaka (voice)","photo":"/3wjTzpJpBiTkLexdMmo9a3wfgRT.jpg","en":"Konomi Kohara"},{"name":"آنا ناگاسه","role":"Naoki Azuma (voice)","photo":"/gFKRUlUlqTD7jGdysg5IWIvgoCH.jpg","en":"Anna Nagase"}],"trailer":"j7dxZjwIhu0","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284445/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284445/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv